{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/walkinggif.gif?t=1751153321\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Coal LLC, your friendly-everyday-evil-coal-mining-corporation. With only a shoddy pickaxe to start, you must hire and promote employees, upgrade equipment and dig deep below the earth to fulfil your coal quota each day. Or else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/LandDeterioration.gif?t=1751153321\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The underground world magically refreshes each day, so you must race to mine as much of it and as deeply as you can before nightfall. Using some very exciting and <i>hyper-realistic</i> methods for doing so. Your world might deteriorate as you grow, however.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/minigun.gif?t=1751153321\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire and promote employees into specialised roles in your organisation, each type having exciting and game-changing bonuses and equipment. Grow your organisation into several hundreds of miners willing to go out and bring back coal for the cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/miningAround.gif?t=1751153321\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many maps and many different starting professions mean endless ways of playing through the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feed the factories. Grow the corporation. Don't be afraid of the consequences. Do you have what it takes to build the greatest coal mining operation of all time?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3361510?t=1751153321","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3361510?t=1751153321","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/47bad948e9a101fe9a31cf1190a57c1118080415/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751153321","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/47bad948e9a101fe9a31cf1190a57c1118080415/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751153321","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3451610,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Now with peaceful mode!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Why must we fill the quotas of our corporate overlords when all I want to do is mine in peace?&quot;,\u00a0</i>Tabatha the Mermaid asks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Well now you can! Well actually now you can't, as this will be in the full release of the game. But we can officially announce that the full game will come with a peaceful mode! So you can mine all of the underground in Coal LLC at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hooray!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/walkinggif.gif?t=1751153321\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Coal LLC, your friendly-everyday-evil-coal-mining-corporation. With only a shoddy pickaxe to start, you must hire and promote employees, upgrade equipment and dig deep below the earth to fulfil your coal quota each day. Or else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/LandDeterioration.gif?t=1751153321\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The underground world magically refreshes each day, so you must race to mine as much of it and as deeply as you can before nightfall. Using some very exciting and <i>hyper-realistic</i> methods for doing so. Your world might deteriorate as you grow, however.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/minigun.gif?t=1751153321\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire and promote employees into specialised roles in your organisation, each type having exciting and game-changing bonuses and equipment. Grow your organisation into several hundreds of miners willing to go out and bring back coal for the cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/extras/miningAround.gif?t=1751153321\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many maps and many different starting professions mean endless ways of playing through the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feed the factories. Grow the corporation. Don't be afraid of the consequences. Do you have what it takes to build the greatest coal mining operation of all time?</p>","developers":["Bye Bye Ocean"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361510/f5a